{"id":"e577570f0f20ff68","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-type-interpretation.md","title":"自由简单类型文法的对象解释","display":"df-type-interpretation — 自由简单类型文法的对象解释","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-type-interpretation","aliases":["16-df-type-interpretation","Interpretation of simple types"],"display":"df-type-interpretation — 自由简单类型文法的对象解释","depends_on":["[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-nno]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-15","source":"§§2.3–2.4, CCC interpretation; explicit local free grammar with designated NNO extension"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-type-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-type-interpretation</span><span>Interpretation of simple types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type-interpretation — 自由简单类型文法的对象解释"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" href=\"?note=ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" title=\"16-df-nno\">16-df-nno</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"source","html":"§§2.3–2.4, CCC interpretation; explicit local free grammar with designated NNO extension"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为基本类型符号集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{base},\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat},\\mathsf{prod},\\mathsf{arr}\">\\(\\mathsf{base},\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat},\\mathsf{prod},\\mathsf{arr}\\)</span> 是单射、两两不交的有限树构造标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat}\">\\(\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat}\\)</span> 为零元标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{base}\">\\(\\mathsf{base}\\)</span> 为一元标签，后两者为二元标签。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(1_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、二元积与指数的 CCC，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to N,s:N\\to N\">\\(z:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to N,s:N\\to N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}(N,z,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}(N,z,s)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" href=\"?note=ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" title=\"16-df-nno\">16-df-nno</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ty}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{Ty}_B\\)</span> 为在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上生成的自由树集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_\\rho:\\operatorname{Ty}_B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(⟦-⟧_\\rho:\\operatorname{Ty}_B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span> 按树递归构造。旧印刷记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,1,\\mathsf{Nat},\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\sigma\\to\\tau\">\\(b,1,\\mathsf{Nat},\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\sigma\\to\\tau\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{base}(b),\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat},\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau),\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathsf{base}(b),\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat},\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau),\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_B^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{base}(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat}\\},\\\\\nT_B^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_B^k\\cup\\{\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau),\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\mid\\sigma,\\tau\\in T_B^k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T_B^k,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{base}(b)⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(b),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{unit}⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq1_{\\mathcal C},&amp;\n⟦\\mathsf{nat}⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq N,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau)⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\n⟦\\sigma⟧_\\rho\\times_{\\mathcal C}⟦\\tau⟧_\\rho,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\n⟦\\tau⟧_\\rho^{⟦\\sigma⟧_\\rho}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_B^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{base}(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat}\\},\\\\\nT_B^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_B^k\\cup\\{\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau),\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\mid\\sigma,\\tau\\in T_B^k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T_B^k,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{base}(b)⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(b),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{unit}⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq1_{\\mathcal C},&amp;\n⟦\\mathsf{nat}⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq N,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau)⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\n⟦\\sigma⟧_\\rho\\times_{\\mathcal C}⟦\\tau⟧_\\rho,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)⟧_\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\n⟦\\tau⟧_\\rho^{⟦\\sigma⟧_\\rho}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源背景：§§2.3–2.4 的积与指数解释；本页把旧笔记中额外指定的自然数对象保留为明确的扩充。自由树标签保证基本符号即使印刷名称为 Nat，也不与零元构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{nat}\">\\(\\mathsf{nat}\\)</span> 相同，因而解释分支互斥。有限树递归及所选积/指数保证定义为全函数。</p>\n<p>本页只定义类型对象解释，不宣称完整项解释、可靠性或 DTT 完备性已完成；源依赖改为 CCC 和 NNO 的实际定义，不再从书中含义不同的 λ-category 推出 CCC＋NNO。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nno","status":"resolved","id":"ddbc8ac3dacc270e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-nno]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为指定终对象 $1_{\\mathcal C}$、二元积与指数的 CCC，见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C$ 及 $z:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to N,s:N\\to N$ 满足 $\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}(N,z,s)$，见 [[16-df-nno]]。$\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nno","status":"resolved","id":"ddbc8ac3dacc270e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为指定终对象 $1_{\\mathcal C}$、二元积与指数的 CCC，见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C$ 及 $z:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to N,s:N\\to N$ 满足 $\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}(N,z,s)$，见 [[16-df-nno]]。$\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{base},\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat},\\mathsf{prod},\\mathsf{arr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{base}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"z:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to N,s:N\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ty}_B","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"⟦-⟧_\\rho:\\operatorname{Ty}_B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"b,1,\\mathsf{Nat},\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\sigma\\to\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{base}(b),\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat},\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau),\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_B^0&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{base}(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{unit},\\mathsf{nat}\\},\\\\\nT_B^{k+1}&\\coloneqq T_B^k\\cup\\{\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau),\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\mid\\sigma,\\tau\\in T_B^k\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}_B&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T_B^k,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{base}(b)⟧_\\rho&\\coloneqq\\rho(b),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{unit}⟧_\\rho&\\coloneqq1_{\\mathcal C},&\n⟦\\mathsf{nat}⟧_\\rho&\\coloneqq N,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{prod}(\\sigma,\\tau)⟧_\\rho&\\coloneqq\n⟦\\sigma⟧_\\rho\\times_{\\mathcal C}⟦\\tau⟧_\\rho,\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf{arr}(\\sigma,\\tau)⟧_\\rho&\\coloneqq\n⟦\\tau⟧_\\rho^{⟦\\sigma⟧_\\rho}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{nat}","display":false}],"bytes":2662,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["18a4c8ba03fadf06","ddbc8ac3dacc270e"]}